      "created_at": "2016-06-18T19:53:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So apparently running the booth off of Foam Brain Games they couldn't keep Exoplanets up as a demo. &nbsp; The reason being is they had a limit on games they could demo each day that weren't actually being sold. &nbsp; So if I had been able to get out Thursday or Friday I may have gotten to it. &nbsp;I got to play Fate of the Elder Gods with Chris Kirkman who got to show off that Dice really do hate him. &nbsp;</p>",
